ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg"> </div><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180735224731_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180735224731_1280.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180735224731_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/match1869198date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆冷！葡萄牙1-1民主刚果 内维斯破门葡萄牙全场7射1正C罗3射0正</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869198_1781721720_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869198_1781721720_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869198_1781721720_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>葡萄牙被爆冷逼平，无缘开门红！若昂·内维斯破门，维萨建功；民主刚果收获世界杯首分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/match1869204date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球大战！英格兰4-2克罗地亚 凯恩双响贝林破门拉什福德替补建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869204_1781733113_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869204_1781733113_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260618/zhanbao_image_1869204_1781733113_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>凯恩双响！贝林厄姆一条龙，拉什福德替补建功，魔笛送点，利瓦科维奇7扑救难救主。</p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31e02ee2db1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">传奇！41岁C罗连续6届世界杯出场，此前连续5届破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e1ca1c3a0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e1ca1c3a0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e1ca1c3a0.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛K组第1轮，葡萄牙1-1战平民主刚果，C罗首发出战，连续6届世界杯出场。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a331b4a76c66native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巨星闪耀世界杯！小组首轮凯恩、哈兰德、姆巴佩双响，梅西戴帽！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180620246813.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180620246813.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180620246813.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯刚刚进行到小组首轮，已经有众多巨星贡献了精彩表演，凯恩、哈兰德、姆巴佩均梅开二度，梅西更是上演帽子戏法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a33073cc2c70native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">追平莱因克尔！凯恩在世界杯已进10球，并列英格兰世界杯射手王！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a33026c1303b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a33026c1303b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a33026c1303b.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯首轮英格兰4-2克罗地亚，凯恩上半场双响，他的世界杯总进球来到10球，追平英格兰世界杯射手王莱因克尔！</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32e75dc4082native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纪录之夜！民主刚果爆冷逼平葡萄牙，收获队史世界杯首球和首分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0705f9fd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0705f9fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/6a32e0705f9fd.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛K组第1轮，民主刚果1-1战平葡萄牙，收获队史世界杯首个积分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32e6d4b9b23native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗本场数据：首发打满全场，3射门0射正，25次触球0次过人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.26" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180300138331.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.26" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.26" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180300138331_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180300138331_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙vs民主刚果，比赛以1-1收场，本场C罗数据如上图。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32f0616893enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大赛10场0球！在世界杯和欧洲杯上，C罗已经连续10场没能破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180308577847.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180308577847.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180308577847.jpg"> </div><p>据统计，C罗在世界杯和欧洲杯上，已经连续10场比赛没能取得进球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32eedc1fa89native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">首秀破门！21岁若昂·内维斯当选葡萄牙1-1民主刚果全场最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180324546674.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1