-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180120121540_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180120121540_720.jpg"> </div><p>武磊在担任世界杯解说嘉宾时，回忆了彼时自己与梅西的交手，也谈到了现在梅西的表现。昨日早晨，梅西上演帽子戏法，阿根廷战胜阿尔及利亚取得世界杯开门红。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32e85221137native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">来自传奇后卫的称赞！马尔蒂尼晒梅西海报：无需多言，这就是最佳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.58" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260618/202606180237407251.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.58" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.58" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260618/202606180237407251.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260618/202606180237407251.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨小组赛首战，阿根廷以3-0的比分完胜阿尔及利亚。本场比赛，阿根廷38岁老将梅西上演了帽子戏法，让自己的职业生涯再添传奇色彩。对于梅西的表现，意大利传奇球星马尔蒂尼进行了称赞。</p><p><strong>【其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a32cd4286b6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨官方：已致函西甲|西足协|裁委会，敦促对弗洛伦蒂诺采取行动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.74" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180038497464.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.74" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.74" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180038497464.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180038497464.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨官方宣布，已经向西甲、西足协、裁判技术委员会正式发函，敦促各方就弗洛伦蒂诺的言论采取行动，捍卫声誉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a331f9c2063dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：利物浦签西班牙国脚穆尼奥斯，激活4000万解约金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180645521954_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180645521954_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260618/202606180645521954_1280.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺用标志性的here we go确认，利物浦截胡纽卡，签下22岁的西班牙国脚边锋穆尼奥斯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a332090e45c6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">2000万欧！利物浦将4000万欧签下穆尼奥斯 皇马有50%转会分成</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-18/6a33203777feanat